{
    "title": "Crocodile Games - Animal Games",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<font color=\"blue\">Are you a fan of wild crocodile games?</font>\r\n\r\nGamePark presents a crocodile game named as Crocodile Games - Animal Games in which you will experience a crocodile simulator by attacking and eating different types of wild animals. It is an ultimate crocodile simulator game in which you will face different types of missions including fighting with other animals, eating them and many more. Let's enjoy hunting!\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f<font color=\"blue\">Game Features!</font>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Realistic Environment & 3d graphics\r\n\u2022 Smooth Controls\r\n\u2022 Stunning sound effects and visuals\r\n\u2022 Enjoy the game with unique crocodile species!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0a<font color=\"blue\">A Variety of Crocodiles are available!</font>\r\n\r\nWe have a lot of crocodiles available for you to be used while playing our game. You can buy these crocodiles with the ingame currency. Hunt as much animals as you can to earn ingame money so that you can buy a crocodile according to your choice.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<font color=\"blue\">The fun didn't stops here!</font>\r\n\r\nThe environments of our crocodile game looks beautiful while playing the game as it has quality graphics. The game controls are simple and easy to use so that every player can easily play our game. The sound effects and other visuals are also used in our game which helps in increasing the game's quality.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<font color=\"blue\">Are you a fan of wild crocodile games?</font><br><br>GamePark presents a crocodile game named as Crocodile Games - Animal Games in which you will experience a crocodile simulator by attacking and eating different types of wild animals. It is an ultimate crocodile simulator game in which you will face different types of missions including fighting with other animals, eating them and many more. Let&#39;s enjoy hunting!<br><br>\u2699\ufe0f<font color=\"blue\">Game Features!</font><br><br>\u2022 Realistic Environment &amp; 3d graphics<br>\u2022 Smooth Controls<br>\u2022 Stunning sound effects and visuals<br>\u2022 Enjoy the game with unique crocodile species!<br><br>\ud83d\udc0a<font color=\"blue\">A Variety of Crocodiles are available!</font><br><br>We have a lot of crocodiles available for you to be used while playing our game. You can buy these crocodiles with the ingame currency. Hunt as much animals as you can to earn ingame money so that you can buy a crocodile according to your choice.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<font color=\"blue\">The fun didn&#39;t stops here!</font><br><br>The environments of our crocodile game looks beautiful while playing the game as it has quality graphics. The game controls are simple and easy to use so that every player can easily play our game. The sound effects and other visuals are also used in our game which helps in increasing the game&#39;s quality.",
